color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008150000</span>8,150<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">50 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a></b>, Turn in 10&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendations: Purple Dragon Knights</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the Purple Dragon Knights. You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification +100%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification +100%</a>:</b> This suit of armor or shield produces a magical force that protects vital areas of the wearer much more effectively. When a critical hit or sneak attack is scored on the wearer, there is a 100% chance that the critical hit or sneak attack is negated and damage is instead rolled normally.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Superior_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Superior False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Superior_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Superior False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +40 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 5/-</b>: Reduces all physical damage by 5.</span></span> 5/-</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Purple_Dragon_Armor.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Purple_Dragon_Armor.png/420px-Purple_Dragon_Armor.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"597\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Purple_Dragon_Armor.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This exquisite platemail armor is of the same make as that worn by the famed Purple Dragon Knights of Cormyr. The smithies of Cormyr are renowned for the quality of their work, and equipment intended for use in service to the kingdom is layered with powerful enchantments by the War Wizards.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816180901\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30831/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11873/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 